{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>A lion's whelp springs from the Bashan.</b> Now a lion does not spring from the Bashan — which is prime pastureland, as it says: אַבִּירֵי בָשָׁן (Psalms 22:13), פָּרוֹת הַבָּשָׁן (Amos 4:1) — unless it is confident of seizing some prey that presents itself outside the Bashan. So too Dan will be confident of conquering its surroundings and will march against them in security."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:37.914781326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}